            "text": "theorem prefixSwirl_radial {h : ℝ} (hh : 0 < h) (hh1 : h < 1 / 2)\n    {d : Coefficients} (hd : SmoothCoefficients d) (J : ℕ) (C : ℝ)\n    {p : Chart} (hp : p.1 < 1) :\n    -AxisymmetricFields.partialS (BaseResidual.prefixSwirl J h C d) p =\n      SlowExpansionResidual.slowSwirl J h C (profiles h d) p"
